{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日1st写真集\n「果実の歩幅」発売日です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ついにこの日が来たんだ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "数ヶ月前からこの日を楽しみに過ごしていました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんもそうだったら嬉しいな！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobUCUfZn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日は会見をさせて頂きました！\n素敵な衣装〜オフショットもインスタ載せたよ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あとはパネル展巡りも！\nいっぱいサインとかコメント書いてきました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mob3BCAtJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "各地で素敵なパネル展が開催中です🤍\n是非この期間に遊びに来てね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは自撮りのオフショットを！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobnyNd7K.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "朝の撮影"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobFjOV2y.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "船長さん🚢"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "i