ype": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "改めて、いつも応援してくださる皆さんのおかげでこんなに素敵な経験をさせていただくことが出来ました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当にありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからも夢や目標を皆さんと叶えていきたいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日は記念日！♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202608/mobnXZXtN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あ！明日の20:30~YouTube配信するよ！\nみてね！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "火曜日もおつかれさまです🐑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "藤嶌果歩"}], "source": "official"}